  decl_var_err_external_init.pcpp - break step of decl_var.pcpp:
  an external variable with an initializer

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_var_err_external_init.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\decl_var_err_external_init.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
